  "body": "Working with a `fieldset`, I was surprised to see it's `form` attribute did not apply to its decendants.  I was expecting functionality similar to a fieldset's `disabled` attribute:\r\n\r\n> The disabled attribute, when specified, causes all the form control descendants of the fieldset element, excluding those that are descendants of the fieldset element's first legend element child, if any, to be disabled.\r\n\r\nI think the usability of the `form` attribute on a fieldset would be much higher with this functionality.",
